# A run's folder keeps its report, `report.json`: every step's record, which later runs size their
# steps by and take their released tests from; its tables, facts and run file; and its listings,
# one file each of the whole run (`archive.gather`). The rest a run rebuilds, or is too large to
# keep: each step's own record and listings under `records/` (the report holds them), the copies it
# fixed, its logs and patches, the Markdown docs/RUNS.md has.
records/
work/
logs/
*.patch
*.log
*.md
*.jsonl
# What the witness's and the guesses' analyses read, and the released tests by name.
!guesses.jsonl
!traced.verdicts.jsonl
!traced.seen.jsonl
!tests-released.tests.jsonl
